  ('36DDF2B0-BCAE-45E1-AB20-E40E36C29643','During a public health crisis, the government may restrict individual liberties-such as freedom of movement or assembly-to protect the common good.',0,NULL,'1170887f-6a78-44dd-a982-c6728e02d7ad',1,0,'2026-08-02T13:49),
  ('F218DFFC-17A4-4961-BF87-E514A481D5EE','Confucian filial piety obligates adult children to obey their parents in major life decisions, such as marriage and career.',0,NULL,'1170887f-6a78-44dd-a982-c6728e02d7ad',1,0,'2026-08-02T13:50:14.8052106'),
  ('1B974E30-182E-4133-9B04-E9740A6FFA69','Wealthy nations have a moral duty to fund vaccination campaigns in poorer countries during a global pandemic, even if those countries do not pose an immediate threat to the wealthy nation''s citizens.',0,NULL,'117088),
  ('C4238BB2-CA48-4DD1-878A-EB4E2A6F8D3A','Removing all regulatory brakes on capitalism and technology will cause a temporary collapse that purges weak institutions, ultimately yielding a more resilient and efficient social order.',0,NULL,'1170887f-6a78-44dd-),
  ('A7BD84E5-D165-4872-A14D-ED821255602F','The Eastern Orthodox Church denies the doctrine of papal supremacy, holding that ultimate authority in the Church resides in ecumenical councils of bishops, not in a single pope.',0,NULL,'1170887f-6a78-44dd-a982-c672),
  ('A2A6A20D-81FF-42B8-B7C4-ED93E7D3C487','According to existentialism, people are fully responsible for their choices and cannot shift blame to their upbringing, society, or genetics.',0,NULL,'1170887f-6a78-44dd-a982-c6728e02d7ad',1,0,'2026-08-02T23:28:15.84),
  ('7CB71083-3D98-4BF1-BC4D-ED9620CE36E8','Shared natural resources like fisheries or irrigation systems can be managed sustainably through local community rules, often outperforming both privatization and top-down government control.',0,NULL,'1170887f-6a78-4),
  ('B755FC58-FF69-4883-A1C7-EDF111352E16','The dictatorship of the proletariat is necessary to dismantle the capitalist state and prevent counter-revolution, establishing true democracy for the working majority.',0,NULL,'1170887f-6a78-44dd-a982-c6728e02d7ad',),
  ('F7AEB843-AF1E-4731-B0E4-F21D95DABA05','The order and creativity in the universe are better explained by the concept of Shiva''s free play of consciousness than by random, purposeless natural processes.',0,NULL,'1170887f-6a78-44dd-a982-c6728e02d7ad',1,0,'2),
  ('623F28FF-BE8B-47BF-9C31-F98BCAB0CFA3','In deity yoga, the practitioner does not merely imagine being a Buddha but genuinely becomes that enlightened being during the meditation session.',0,NULL,'1170887f-6a78-44dd-a982-c6728e02d7ad',1,0,'2026-08-02T13:14:),
  ('0F08F8C2-123F-4069-AACD-FFBA292EF939','Large-scale deforestation violates the spiritual relationship between humans and the forest, causing harm that is both ecological and spiritual.',0,NULL,'1170887f-6a78-44dd-a982-c6728e02d7ad',1,0,'2026-08-02T06:25:27)
) AS source (Id, Text, Type, SourceUrl, UserId, IsAIGenerated, IsConfirmed, CreatedAt)
